  "description": "The Batch E-Step-Thru Plus in Ocean Blue is the perfect mix of power, comfort, and go-anywhere versatility. Designed for riders who want to explore more — with a little help — this e-bike features the Bosch Active Line Plus motor offering 50Nm of torque to make hills and long rides feel effortless. The 400Wh Bosch Powerpack gives you ample range, while the low step-thru frame makes it easy to hop on and off, no matter your outfit or destination.\nWith a Suntour NEX suspension fork, Kenda all-surface tires, and a comfort-tuned cockpit, every ride feels smooth and relaxed — whether you're commuting, cruising, or rediscovering the joy of two wheels. It’s equipped with trusted Shimano 9-speed shifting, Tektro hydraulic disc brakes, and thoughtfully chosen components that make every ride simple and satisfying. Built for riders who want reliability, ease, and fun in every mile — the E-Step-Thru Plus is your ticket to riding more often, and going farther.",
